{
  "_comment": [
    "Registered publisher domains and their credentials.",
    "",
    "The real file is never committed: it holds one API key per publisher.",
    "Copy this to provisioning.json on the server and fill in real keys with",
    "  python3 -c 'import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))'",
    "",
    "A domain listed here can provision itself: the plugin proves control by",
    "serving a nonce at /.well-known/newshare-challenge, and this service",
    "fetches it before issuing anything. Registration is the certification",
    "step -- being in this file is what ITEGA decided, not what the plugin",
    "asked for.",
    "",
    "Set \"revoked\": true to stop issuing for a domain without deleting the",
    "record, so the audit trail survives."
  ],
  "domains": {
    "example.org": {
      "name": "Example Publisher",
      "pub_mbr_id": "ITEGA-XX-0000",
      "api_key": "replace-me",
      "revoked": false
    }
  }
}
